So if you want to change username, it's user is the entity

03:46.050 --> 03:49.980
or the group that we reference in square brackets.

03:49.980 --> 03:52.980
You don't have to indent, but everybody does.

03:52.980 --> 03:55.560
It makes it clear this relationship here,

03:55.560 --> 03:58.290
that name is nested under user,

03:58.290 --> 04:00.990
